   "DCF: Pythia model CL_DCF_Model, Nov 17, 2026; WACC 7.5%, g 2.5%, 5-year horizon. Street avg target = 21-analyst average (S&P Global via StockAnalysis). Morningstar FV $88 (Aug 3, 2026).",
